#: includes/admin/class-help.php:503
msgid "More help"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:506
msgid "Support"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:562
msgid "Read the full article in the knowledge base"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:586
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:589
msgid ""
"The analysis reads your plugins, themes, database and files and works out "
"who owns each record and file. It runs in the background in stages, so the "
"window can be closed, and it changes nothing on the site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:590
msgid ""
"starts a new analysis straight away, whatever the low-traffic window says; "
"at most five per hour."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:591
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:990
#: includes/admin/screen.php:1267 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1422
msgid "View report"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:591
msgid "opens a printable summary of the last analysis in a new window."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:592
msgid ""
"Below the buttons, the date of the last analysis. If the database cut some "
"of its queries short, a notice says so and the database lists keep the "
"results of the previous analysis."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:608
msgid ""
"Where your site stands and what to do next. Nothing on this page changes "
"your site: each suggestion opens the screen that does it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:609 includes/admin/screen.php:879
msgid "Site status"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:609
msgid ""
"three cards: the weight of the autoloaded options (healthy under 800 KB), "
"the orphaned data the analysis found and the state of the object cache."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:610
msgid ""
"a score out of 100 with the server response time and up to three ways to "
"raise it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:611
msgid ""
"orphaned records, an analysis older than 14 days, heavy autoload, "
"reclaimable media space and orphaned scheduled tasks, each with a link to "
"the screen that fixes it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:612
msgid ""
"the records and files of the last analysis by state, with a link to each "
"list."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:630
msgid ""
"Measures how long WordPress takes to start sending the page (the server "
"share of TTFB) and lists what can make it faster."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:631 includes/admin/trait-media.php:1264
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:162
msgid "Summary"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:631
msgid "the measured response time, its trend and the verdict."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:632 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:385
msgid "PageSpeed Insights"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:632
msgid ""
"tests a page of your site, on mobile or desktop, with the public API of "
"Google. It sends the address of that page to Google and changes nothing on "
"your site. With your own API key you can also load the history of real "
"visitors (Chrome UX Report)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:633 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:164
msgid "Server"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:633
msgid ""
"the levers the plugin can apply with one click (object cache, query "
"deduplication, autoload, Heartbeat), the ones that need server access as "
"guidance (system cron, PHP and OPcache) and a read-only check of the "
"database and Redis."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:635 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1390
msgid "Deep analysis (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:635
msgid ""
"profiles the next few front-end requests and switches itself off. The report "
"shows the slowest hooks and queries; \"Apply index\" creates a database "
"index after asking, and \"Undo\" drops it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:653
msgid ""
"Where you started versus where you are now. A snapshot is taken "
"automatically before and after every analysis and after every cleanup."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:654 includes/admin/trait-history.php:89
msgid "Set baseline to now"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:654
msgid "takes a new starting point to compare with. Earlier snapshots are kept."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:655 includes/admin/class-help.php:1120
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:989
#: includes/admin/trait-history.php:96
msgid "Export CSV"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:655
msgid "downloads every snapshot, to open it in a spreadsheet."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:656 includes/admin/trait-history.php:116
msgid "Keep timeline data:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:656
msgid ""
"three months by default. Choosing a shorter period deletes the older "
"snapshots at once; the baseline and the first snapshot are always kept."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:670
msgid "Object and page cache"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:673
msgid ""
"Every cache is off until you turn it on, and turning it off puts back what "
"was there. A drop-in that belongs to another plugin is never overwritten "
"unless you choose to replace it, and the original is kept to give it back."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:674
msgid ""
"keeps the results of database queries in Redis, Memcached, APCu or a SQLite "
"file. Enabling it writes wp-content/object-cache.php."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:675 includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1223
#: includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1385 includes/compat/registry.php:67
msgid "Page cache"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:675
msgid ""
"serves a static copy of each page to anonymous visitors for up to 10 hours, "
"and clears what changes. Logged-in users, carts, checkout and the admin are "
"never cached. Enabling it writes wp-content/advanced-cache.php and adds "
"WP_CACHE to wp-config.php. It is not available on a multisite network, and "
"it stays off while another page cache is active."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:676 includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1463
msgid "Preload"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:676
msgid "rebuilds the cached pages in the background after they are cleared."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:678 includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1495
msgid "Custom exclusions"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:678
msgid ""
"paths, cookies and query parameters on top of the automatic rules, and a "
"separate cache for mobile devices."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:680 includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1227
#: includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1793 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:290
msgid "Query deduplication"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:680
msgid ""
"writes wp-content/db.php, which answers identical read queries of the same "
"request from memory. Any write clears it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:681 includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1229
msgid "Analytics"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:681
msgid "hit rate, queries and the most duplicated queries of the last 30 days."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:682
msgid ""
"the backend and its connection, Heartbeat and the cached comment counts of "
"the dashboard. Saving flushes the object cache."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:686
msgid "Cloudflare"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:689
msgid ""
"With the zone ID and an API token with permission to purge the cache, the "
"plugin also clears Cloudflare: everything when it flushes the other caches, "
"and only the affected pages when content changes. Both are on once the token "
"is saved. Saving tests it by purging the home page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:690 includes/admin/trait-cache.php:870
msgid "Cache the pages at Cloudflare too"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:690
msgid ""
"creates a Cache Rule in your Cloudflare zone, which needs one more "
"permission, checks it and removes it by itself if the check fails. Turning "
"it off deletes the rule and empties the edge."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:694 includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1225
#: includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1540
msgid "Browser & server"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:697 includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1551
msgid "Caches in front of your site"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:697
msgid ""
"requests the home page twice as a visitor and reads the headers to see "
"whether your host or a CDN keeps a copy. When it finds Varnish, it can purge "
"it too, unless Proxy Cache Purge already does."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:698 includes/admin/trait-cache.php:1593
msgid "Browser cache & compression"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:698
msgid ""
"adds a block to .htaccess, after a copy of the file, so browsers keep your "
"static files and the server compresses them. Not available on Nginx, and not "
"added while another plugin handles it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:712 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:101
msgid "CSS & JavaScript"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:715
msgid ""
"What the browser of the visitor downloads and runs. Everything is off by "
"default, and stays off while another optimizer is active."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:716 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:54
msgid "Minification"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:716
msgid ""
"serves minified copies of your own CSS and JavaScript; files already "
"minified, external or excluded are left as they are. Test mode applies it "
"only to logged-in administrators. Saving clears the minified copies."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:718 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:57
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1221
msgid "Delay JavaScript"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:718
msgid ""
"holds scripts back until the visitor moves, taps, scrolls or types, and runs "
"them anyway after 8 seconds. By default only known third parties are "
"delayed. Consent banners, payment providers and captchas are never delayed. "
"Add ?wpopt_nodelay=1 to an address to load everything at once."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:719 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:59
#: includes/compat/registry.php:76
msgid "Critical CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:719
msgid ""
"works out the CSS each template uses and inlines it. Generate shows the "
"sizes and a preview without changing anything; \"Apply to the site\" turns "
"it on, and \"Delete and revert\" removes it. Add ?wpopt_noccss=1 to an "
"address to see the page without it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:720 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:61
#: includes/admin/trait-plugin-rules.php:25
msgid "Plugins by URL"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:720
msgid ""
"stops a plugin from loading where it does nothing, or loads it only where it "
"is needed. Only for visitors. Every rule is tested on real pages before it "
"is saved, and every rule switches itself off if a visit ends in a fatal "
"error. Saving writes a must-use plugin and clears the page cache."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:725 includes/admin/trait-performance.php:64
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:69
msgid "Loading & delivery"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:728
msgid "How the page reaches the visitor. All optional and off by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:729 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1048
msgid "Speculative loading"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:729
msgid ""
"the browser prepares the next page on click (conservative) or on hover "
"(eager). The admin, login, cart and checkout are left out."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:730 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1060
msgid "Image loading"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:730
msgid "gives priority to the first image and lazy-loads the rest."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:731 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1064
msgid "Preload key resources"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:731
msgid "the featured image and any address you add."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:732 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1071
msgid "Lazy embeds"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:732
msgid ""
"iframes load when they are reached, and YouTube videos show a thumbnail "
"until they are clicked."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:733 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1075
msgid "Server-Timing"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:733
msgid ""
"a header with the time the server took, to read in the developer tools of "
"the browser."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:734 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1078
msgid "Resource hints"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:734
msgid ""
"automatic: preconnect for the Google Fonts origins and dns-prefetch for the "
"other external origins whose scripts and styles the page loads."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:735 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1081
msgid "Google Fonts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:735
msgid "downloads the fonts to your server and serves them from there."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:736 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1095
#: includes/compat/registry.php:83
msgid "CDN rewriting"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:736
msgid ""
"serves the files of the chosen folders from your CDN host; with no folder "
"ticked, all three."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:753
msgid ""
"The CSS and JavaScript loaded on your public pages, with the plugin or theme "
"each one belongs to. Every change is saved at once."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:754 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1697
msgid "Manual unloading"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:754
msgid ""
"stops loading the ticked assets on the front end. The admin is never "
"touched, and WordPress core and jQuery cannot be ticked."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:756 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1706
msgid "Automatic unloading"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:756
msgid ""
"stops loading the assets of a plugin or theme on the pages where it is not "
"used, following the knowledge base."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:758 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1740
msgid "Test mode"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:758
msgid ""
"applies the unloading only to logged-in administrators, to check it before "
"visitors see it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:759 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1750
msgid "URL exceptions"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:759
msgid "pages that always keep every asset."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:760 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1822
msgid "Per-rule targeting"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:760
msgid ""
"where each rule applies: everywhere, the front page, posts and pages, "
"archives, one content type or some addresses."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:761 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1780
msgid "Rules that are not doing anything"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:761
msgid ""
"rules of deactivated extensions, which are kept, and rules that match "
"nothing, which can be removed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:778
msgid ""
"Autoloaded options load into memory on every request; under about 800 KB in "
"total is healthy. Disabling autoload keeps the option and stops loading it "
"on every page, and it can be undone."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:779 includes/admin/trait-autoload.php:249
msgid "Disable autoload for selected"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:779
msgid ""
"saves a backup first, then stops loading the selected options on every "
"request."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:780 includes/admin/trait-autoload.php:216
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:315
msgid "Smart Deactivation"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:780
msgid ""
"the same for the options confidently identified as belonging to uninstalled "
"extensions."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:781 includes/admin/trait-autoload.php:243
msgid "Advanced autoload cleanup"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:781
msgid ""
"disables autoload for the options never read, or for every non-essential "
"one, and deletes the confirmed orphans. Deleting is the only action here "
"that removes options, and it saves a backup first."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:782 includes/admin/trait-autoload.php:132
#: includes/admin/trait-autoload.php:316
msgid "Could be autoloaded"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:782
msgid ""
"options read on almost every request without being autoloaded. The plugin "
"measures it by itself; Smart Activation autoloads those read on at least 90% "
"of 50 or more requests, up to 20 KB each."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:799
msgid ""
"A maintenance pass over revisions, drafts, trash, comments, transients and "
"the other tasks chosen in Settings. Everything it deletes is backed up first "
"and can be restored from Backups; if a backup cannot be written, the cleanup "
"stops."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:800 includes/admin/trait-cleanup-tab.php:1240
msgid "Preview (dry run)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:800
msgid ""
"counts what the cleanup would remove with the current settings, without "
"deleting anything."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:801 includes/admin/trait-cleanup-tab.php:1250
msgid "Run general cleanup now"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:801
msgid ""
"runs it straight away, after asking. Every enabled task runs, whatever its "
"frequency."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:802 includes/admin/trait-cleanup-tab.php:1080
#: includes/admin/trait-cleanup-tab.php:1268
msgid "Logs"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:802
msgid ""
"the last run and the previous reports, to view, download or print. Event "
"lines are included only with \"Generate detailed log\"."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:803 includes/admin/trait-cleanup-tab.php:1082
msgid "By content type"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:803
msgid "where the weight of your database sits by content type. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:804 includes/admin/trait-cleanup-tab.php:1134
msgid "Active settings"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:804
msgid ""
"the tasks and limits are chosen in Settings, under General cleanup options."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:821
msgid ""
"Every table of this site with its engine, rows, size, recoverable overhead "
"and suspected owner. Optimizing and converting never delete data, so they do "
"not make a backup. Orphaned custom tables are deleted from Analysis results."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:822 includes/admin/trait-tables.php:485
msgid "Unusual table growth since the previous scan"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:822
msgid "tables that grew at least 5 MB and 25% between two analyses."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:823 includes/admin/trait-tables.php:533
msgid "Tables worth a look"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:823
msgid ""
"tables whose owner is not active, or that are very large for the database."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:824 includes/admin/trait-media.php:287
#: includes/admin/trait-tables.php:726
msgid "Optimize selected"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:824
msgid ""
"runs OPTIMIZE TABLE. On InnoDB the reported free space may not drop, and "
"that is normal."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:825 includes/admin/trait-tables.php:742
msgid "Convert selected to InnoDB"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:825
msgid "changes only the MyISAM tables and keeps all their data."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:826
msgid "Tables over 256 MB are not converted from the browser, because it would take minutes and as much free disk space. When optimized, they are rebuilt in the background if that recovers space, and skipped otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:843
msgid ""
"The scheduled tasks of WordPress. An event whose hook has no callback and no "
"installed owner is orphaned: it will never run."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:844 includes/admin/trait-cron.php:507
msgid "WP-Cron trigger"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:844
msgid ""
"\"Disable WP-Cron\" adds DISABLE_WP_CRON to wp-config.php, after a copy of "
"the file listed in Backups, and gives the line to add to the crontab of the "
"server. \"Re-enable WP-Cron\" removes it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:845 includes/admin/trait-cron.php:363
msgid "Are the tasks running?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:845
msgid ""
"warns when an event is more than 10 minutes late, because then nothing is "
"firing WP-Cron."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:846
msgid ""
"queues the task to run in the background in a moment, after a backup of its "
"events."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:847
msgid ""
"the task stays scheduled but does nothing until you resume it. WordPress "
"core tasks cannot be paused."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:848 includes/admin/trait-cron.php:331
msgid "Unschedule selected"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:848
msgid ""
"removes orphaned events only, after a backup restorable from Backups. Active "
"and WordPress core events are protected."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:865
msgid ""
"The uploads folder as the last analysis found it. Every deletion here saves "
"a copy of the files first, restorable from Trash or Backups."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:866
msgid ""
"files with no record in the database, thumbnails whose original is missing "
"and files in named folders, usually left by plugins. Review them before "
"deleting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:867 includes/admin/trait-media.php:27
#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:1243
msgid "Duplicate sets"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:867
msgid ""
"byte-identical files. The copy with the lowest ID is kept, featured images "
"and content are pointed to it and the other copies are deleted. A set still "
"used somewhere the plugin cannot rewrite is left alone."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:868 includes/admin/trait-media.php:28
#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:1245
msgid "Unused attachments"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:868
msgid ""
"attachments with no reference found in content, meta, galleries or parent "
"posts. It is a heuristic: confirm each one, or mark it as known to keep it. "
"References are checked again before deleting, and \"Delete all\" is refused "
"when the search was incomplete."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:869 includes/admin/trait-media.php:1008
#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:1249
msgid "Trash"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:869
msgid ""
"the copies of the deleted media. Restore puts the files back; Delete removes "
"the copy for good and frees its space."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:873 includes/admin/screen.php:1653
#: includes/admin/trait-docs.php:302 includes/admin/trait-media.php:428
#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:1247
msgid "Image optimization"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:876
msgid ""
"The weight and formats of your images and what would help each one. The "
"analysis runs with \"Analyze now\"."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:878 includes/admin/trait-media.php:622
msgid "Optimize originals"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:878
msgid ""
"recompresses the JPEG and PNG originals and resizes those larger than the "
"maximum, after a byte-verified copy of each one; \"Restore originals\" puts "
"them back."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:879 includes/admin/trait-media.php:652
msgid "Generate next-gen copies"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:879
msgid ""
"creates WebP and AVIF copies next to each image, without changing the "
"original. Remove deletes only the copies made by the plugin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:881
msgid ""
"quality (82 by default), maximum dimensions (2560 × 2560), folders never "
"optimized, image sizes no longer generated for new uploads, and optimizing "
"new uploads as they arrive. Serving WebP and AVIF as <picture> sources is on "
"by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:882 includes/admin/trait-media.php:379
msgid "Serve WebP/AVIF from the server"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:882
msgid ""
"adds a rule to the .htaccess of the uploads folder, after a copy of it, and "
"checks that it works. On Nginx it gives the configuration instead."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:886 includes/admin/trait-media-audit.php:295
#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:1251
msgid "Library audit"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:889
msgid ""
"An examination of the uploads folder and the attachment records behind it, "
"run only when you click \"Run the audit\". It says whose each file is and "
"never moves anything."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:890 includes/admin/trait-media-audit.php:356
msgid "Files that should not be downloadable"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:890
msgid ""
"database dumps, logs and backups left in uploads, each checked with a real "
"request. \"Protect these files\" adds an .htaccess rule that blocks them; "
"they can also be deleted, after a backup."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:891 includes/admin/trait-media-audit.php:424
msgid "Sizes carrying an older name"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:891
msgid ""
"regenerates the thumbnails, up to 10 attachments at a time, after a backup "
"of their metadata. The old files are not deleted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:892 includes/admin/trait-media-audit.php:392
msgid "Files claimed twice"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:892
msgid ""
"files claimed at once by the metadata of an attachment and by an address the "
"theme rewrites, which makes moving them unsafe. Report only."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:893 includes/admin/trait-media-audit.php:402
msgid "Sizes no registered size could produce"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:893 includes/admin/class-help.php:894
msgid "they can be deleted, after a backup."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:894 includes/admin/trait-media-audit.php:477
msgid "Files in the uploads root"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:911
msgid ""
"Every record and file the last analysis attributed, filtered by state. Each "
"state has a Database and a Files view."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:912
msgid ""
"left behind by extensions that are no longer installed. Nothing on the site "
"uses them; delete them unless you plan to reinstall that extension and keep "
"its settings."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:913
msgid ""
"no owner could be identified. They may belong to something still in use: "
"review them one by one, attribute them by hand or ask the attribution "
"assistant."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:914
msgid ""
"they belong to installed but deactivated plugins or themes. Delete them only "
"if you will not use those extensions again. Plugins & Themes lists them to "
"uninstall."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:915
msgid ""
"records with no value stored. Those of active extensions or of WordPress are "
"read-only."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:916
msgid ""
"they belong to active extensions or WordPress. Nothing is deleted here: fix "
"a wrong owner, protect a record or deactivate plugins and themes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:920
msgid "Confidence levels"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:923
msgid ""
"How much is known about the owner of each record. Only Manual, Sure, Likely "
"and Possible can be deleted; anything lower goes to To identify."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:924
#: includes/resolvers/confidence-levels.php:109
msgid "Manual"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:924
msgid "you attributed it yourself, and it outranks every automatic source."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:925
#: includes/resolvers/confidence-levels.php:110
msgid "Sure"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:925
msgid ""
"captured live on this site, by a plugin whose own namespace the item belongs "
"to."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:926
#: includes/resolvers/confidence-levels.php:111
msgid "Likely"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:926
msgid ""
"seen by comparing what the site registered before and after activating the "
"extension."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:927
#: includes/resolvers/confidence-levels.php:112
msgid "Possible"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:927
msgid ""
"read from the code of the extension, or confirmed by several sites in the "
"shared dataset."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:928
#: includes/resolvers/confidence-levels.php:113
msgid "Doubtful"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:928
msgid ""
"one claim only, outside the namespace of the claimant, or reported by few "
"sites."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:929
#: includes/resolvers/confidence-levels.php:114
msgid "Estimated"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:929
msgid "inferred from a prefix or a slug."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:930
#: includes/resolvers/confidence-levels.php:115
msgid "Undetermined"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:930
msgid "no owner found."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:934
msgid "Deleting and uninstalling"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:937
msgid "Every deletion makes a backup first, and if it cannot be made nothing is deleted. Before deleting, each record is checked again: anything now in use, part of WordPress or no longer in the last analysis is kept, and very large entries are refused with the reason, since backing them up from the browser is not possible. The content of orphaned custom post types and the terms of orphaned taxonomies are only deleted when you tick that option."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:938
msgid ""
"acts on every filtered record; once rows are ticked the button deletes only "
"the selection. The notice that follows offers Undo for one day."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:939
msgid ""
"protected records are never deleted by any cleanup until you unprotect them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:940
msgid ""
"copies the folder of each plugin or theme to Backups and then deletes it the "
"WordPress way, which also runs its own uninstall routine; what that routine "
"removes from the database is not in the copy. With the option ticked, the "
"data and files the analysis found for them are deleted too, after a backup."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:942
msgid ""
"without an active license every list is analysed and the first 25 records "
"are shown; deleting and uninstalling need the license."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:947 includes/admin/trait-docs.php:388
msgid "Manual attribution"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:950 includes/admin/trait-cleanup-tab.php:240
msgid "Attribute manually"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:950
msgid ""
"tells WPOptimizing who owns an item when the automatic attribution is wrong "
"or missing: \"Contains\" for a family of items, \"Exact value\" for one. "
"Your rule takes priority, and the item moves to In use, Inactive or Orphans "
"at once, without a new analysis. An item whose owner is active can no longer "
"be deleted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:951 includes/admin/trait-attr-suggest.php:154
#: includes/admin/trait-docs.php:400
msgid "Attribution assistant"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:951
msgid ""
"suggests owners from the shared knowledge base, for To identify, or checks "
"the owners shown, for Orphans. It needs data sharing. After each analysis "
"the sure owners are applied on their own; the rest change only when you "
"click Accept, one by one or all the sure ones at once, which creates a rule."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:968
msgid ""
"What changed in WordPress since WPOptimizing was installed: tables, options, "
"meta keys, scheduled events and plugin, theme and upload folders added or "
"removed, with the date and the extension responsible when it is known. It is "
"recorded when plugins or themes change and after every analysis, and keeps "
"the latest 2,000 changes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:969 includes/admin/trait-activity.php:123
msgid "Clear activity log"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:969
msgid ""
"empties the list; the starting point is kept, so tracking continues from now."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:986
msgid ""
"The copies made before deletions, cleanups, autoload changes, uninstalls and "
"edits of .htaccess and wp-config.php. They are kept in wp-content/"
"wpoptimizing/backups/, and how many and for how long is set in Settings."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:987 includes/admin/trait-backups.php:126
#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:1069
msgid "Restore"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:987
msgid ""
"puts back the database rows and the files of that operation. The backup is "
"kept after restoring."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:988
msgid "removes the backup for good."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:989 includes/admin/trait-backups.php:50
msgid "Create backup now"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:989
msgid ""
"saves every record and file of the last analysis, without deleting anything. "
"It is not a full backup of the site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1006
msgid ""
"A quick reference for every feature inside the plugin, in three groups: "
"Performance, Cleanup and Tools & data. The question mark next to a section "
"title opens the same text. The full manual, with every setting explained, is "
"the knowledge base."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1021 includes/admin/class-help.php:1123
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:324
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:1042
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:1118
#: includes/admin/screen.php:1376 includes/admin/screen.php:1474
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:384 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1269
#: wpoptimizing.php:1197
msgid "License"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1024 includes/admin/screen.php:1482
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:407 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:418
msgid "License key"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1024
msgid ""
"enter it and click Activate. Once stored it is hidden; deactivate it to "
"enter another one. Without an active license everything is analysed and "
"shown, and deleting attributed records and uninstalling extensions are not "
"available."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1029
msgid "Backups and notifications"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1032 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:442
msgid "Max backups per type"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1032
msgid "25 by default; the oldest of each type are deleted automatically."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1033 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:446
msgid "Max age (days)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1033
msgid "backups older than this are deleted automatically; 30 by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1034 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:451
msgid "Max backup size (MB)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1034
msgid ""
"when the backups would grow past it (2048 MB by default), the change stops "
"instead of filling the disk. 0 means no limit."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1035 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:456
msgid "Notification email"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1035
msgid ""
"where the periodic report is sent; the address of the site administrator "
"when empty. Separate several addresses with commas."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1036 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:468
#: includes/maintenance-report.php:377
msgid "Maintenance report"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1036
msgid ""
"an email with the health score, the main figures and the activity, daily to "
"monthly. Off by default. \"Send a test now\" sends one at once without "
"changing the schedule."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1037 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:481
msgid "Background sweeper"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1037
msgid ""
"clears expired transients a few at a time on admin requests; off by default, "
"and idle with a persistent object cache."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1038 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:487
msgid "On uninstall"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1038
msgid ""
"on by default: deleting the plugin deletes its settings, backups and "
"analysis data. The drop-ins, the must-use plugins and the lines added to wp-"
"config.php are removed in any case. Optimized images are kept."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1042
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:798
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:502 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1238
msgid "Quick profile"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1045 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:509
msgid "Apply a preset"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1045
msgid ""
"Safe, Blog, WooCommerce, Membership or Agency (maximum), with the one that "
"suits your site marked as recommended. Applying it sets the cleanup tasks, "
"front-end performance, core tweaks and Heartbeat, and turns on the object "
"cache and query deduplication. The cleanup schedule is not changed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1049 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1242
msgid "Cleanup options"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1052 includes/admin/trait-cleanup-tab.php:1144
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:571
msgid "Revisions to keep per post"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1052
msgid ""
"2 by default; the older revisions of each post are deleted on every cleanup. "
"A post marked \"Keep all revisions\" keeps all of them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1053 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:590
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:613
msgid "Database cleanup tasks"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1053
msgid ""
"what the general cleanup removes. Auto-drafts, trashed posts, spam and "
"trashed comments, expired transients and table optimization are on by "
"default; the rest are off."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1054 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:586
msgid "Keep trash and spam for at least (days)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1054
msgid ""
"leaves alone what was sent to the trash or marked as spam more recently, so "
"a mistake can still be undone."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1055 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:658
msgid "Automatic analysis"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1055
msgid ""
"daily by default, only inside the low-traffic window (02:00 to 06:00, site "
"time). A manual analysis always runs at once."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1056 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:685
msgid "Automatic maintenance"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1056
msgid ""
"runs the general cleanup on a schedule, from hourly to monthly. Manual only "
"by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1057 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:764
msgid "Per-task frequency (advanced)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1057
msgid ""
"how often each task runs on automatic runs; \"Never\" skips it. Manual runs "
"always run every enabled task."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1058 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:778
msgid "Auto-clean on DB growth"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1058
msgid ""
"runs the general cleanup when the database grows more than this many MB "
"since the last one. 0 disables it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1062 includes/admin/trait-docs.php:292
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:818 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1250
msgid "Core tweaks"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1065
msgid ""
"Turn off WordPress features you do not use. Every option is off by default "
"and reversible; nothing is deleted. The safe ones only remove noise from the "
"head; the moderate ones (jQuery Migrate, Dashicons, oEmbed, remote patterns, "
"REST links, WooCommerce cart fragments) may affect a few setups, so review "
"each one."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1066 includes/admin/trait-docs.php:277
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:794 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1246
msgid "Front-end performance"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1066
msgid "these settings are now in Speed › Page & browser."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1070 includes/admin/trait-docs.php:484
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:894 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1281
msgid "Webhooks"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1073 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:904
msgid "Endpoint URL"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1073
msgid ""
"receives a JSON POST when an analysis, a cleanup, a deletion or a dataset "
"upload finishes. Leave it empty to disable webhooks."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1074 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:909
msgid "Signing secret"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1074
msgid ""
"optional; each request then carries an X-WPOptimizing-Signature header with "
"the HMAC-SHA256 of the body."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1075 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:914
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:915
msgid "Events"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1075
msgid "which events are sent; with none selected, all of them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1079 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1254
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1082
msgid ""
"The optimization plugins found on the site and what each one already does. "
"Where doing it twice would conflict, the WPOptimizing version stays off."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1083 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1375
msgid "Use WPOptimizing for this anyway"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1083
msgid "runs ours as well for that feature."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1087 includes/admin/trait-docs.php:493
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1258
msgid "Shared dataset"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1090 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:949
msgid "Contribute & receive"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1090
msgid ""
"off by default. When on, the names of options, meta keys, tables and files, "
"their sizes and how often they are seen are sent with the domain of the "
"site, and the shared dataset is received in return. Values and content are "
"never sent."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1091 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1003
msgid "Sync dataset now"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1091
msgid "uploads and downloads at once instead of waiting for the daily sync."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1095 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1262
msgid "Import / export"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1098 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1483
msgid "Download settings (.json)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1098
msgid ""
"a file with the configuration, to set another site up the same way. Keys, "
"passwords, webhooks and the data-sharing consent are never included."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1099 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1489
msgid "Import settings"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1099
msgid ""
"overwrites the current settings with those of the file; unknown entries are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1100 includes/admin/trait-settings.php:344
msgid "Replay welcome wizard"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1100
msgid "shows the welcome wizard again on the main screen."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1114
msgid "Network"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1117
msgid ""
"A read-only summary of every site of the network. Each site analyses and "
"cleans its own data; open a site to manage it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1118
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:791
msgid "Network quick setup"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1118
msgid ""
"applies a quick profile to every site or to the ones chosen, and sets the "
"alert thresholds of that profile. Nothing is deleted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1119
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:987
msgid "Analyze all sites"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1119
msgid "schedules a new analysis on every site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1120
msgid ""
"the table, to open it in a spreadsheet; View report opens a printable "
"version."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1121
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:1155
msgid "Email alerts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1121
msgid ""
"a daily summary to the network administrator when a site has this much "
"orphaned data, has not been analysed in this many days or has this much "
"autoload. 0 disables each one; the same sites are not reported again for a "
"week."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-help.php:1123
msgid "activates or deactivates the license of each site from its row."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:299
msgid "Network Report"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:300
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:200
#: includes/cleanup/class-general-cleanup.php:1616
msgid "Generated:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:303
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:317
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:998
msgid "Sites"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:307
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:1005
msgid "Licensed"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:312
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:330
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1166
msgid "Pending"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:315
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:334
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:1017
#: includes/admin/class-network-dashboard.php:1051
msgid "Scanned size"
