msgid "More delivery options"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1742
msgid ""
"Smart Assets stops the CSS and JavaScript a page does not need — site-wide, "
"on chosen URLs or on a single page — with a test mode that applies it to "
"administrators first."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1745
msgid "Smart Assets is not included in this plugin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1747
msgid "Smart Assets is part of Pro and needs an active license."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1758
msgid ""
"The CSS and JavaScript actually loaded on your public pages. You can stop "
"specific assets from loading, on the whole site or only where you choose, "
"and let the knowledge base unload them automatically where they are not "
"needed."
msgstr ""

